---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { newest, entries } from '../data/entries';
const latest = newest[0];
const selected = entries.filter(e => e.milestone).slice(0, 3);
---
<Base title="Home">
  <section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">An unfinished game / an honest archive</p><h1>They Forgot the Alamo</h1><p class="lead">A man wakes up believing he’s Davy Crockett. There’s a shotgun, a destructible room, and a raccoon where his hat should be.</p><p>Current status: playable room prototype · Last documented game update: October 2, 2026</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/play/">Play status</a><a class="button secondary" href="/devlog/">Read the dev log</a><a class="button secondary" href="/timeline/">Explore the timeline</a></div></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="/media/two-hand-carry.webp" alt="October 2 game capture of Davy holding the shotgun" fetchpriority="high" /></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Latest from the room</p><h2>Recent dispatch</h2></div><a href="/devlog/">All entries →</a></div><div class="split"><img src={latest.image || '/media/current-room.webp'} alt={latest.imageAlt || latest.title} loading="lazy" /><div><p class="date">{latest.date} / Development record</p><h3><a href={'/devlog/'+latest.slug+'/'}>{latest.title}</a></h3><p>{latest.summary}</p><a class="button secondary" href={'/devlog/'+latest.slug+'/'}>Read entry</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The trail so far</p><h2>Milestones</h2></div><a href="/timeline/">Full timeline →</a></div><div class="grid">{selected.map(e => <a class="card milestone" href={'/devlog/'+e.slug+'/'}>{e.image && <img src={e.image} alt={e.imageAlt} loading="lazy" />}<div class="card-content"><span class="date">{e.date}</span><h3>{e.title}</h3><p>{e.summary}</p></div></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">Then / now</p><h2>From shapes to a character</h2><p>The first playable Davy was assembled from primitives. The B3 model, B4 rig, and October 2 shotgun work brought a designed silhouette and animation, with all the awkward alignment work that entails.</p><div class="comparison"><figure><img src="/media/first-commit-room.webp" alt="First surviving game build from September 29, reconstructed in a browser" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Before / September 29 build, reconstructed October 1</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/media/two-hand-carry.webp" alt="October 2 game room capture with Davy carrying the shotgun" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>After / October 2 review capture</figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">Build state</p><h2>What exists now</h2><div class="grid"><div><h3>Working systems</h3><p>Movement, camera, two-shell shotgun, reload, breakable targets and walls, debris, graphics switches, and the Q raccoon transition.</p></div><div><h3>Still being made</h3><p>Character presentation, animation, graphics tuning, and the move from a test room to a full game.</p></div><div><h3>Archive count</h3><p>{entries.length} evidence-linked entries, {entries.filter(e=>e.milestone).length} marked milestones. This archive begins with the earliest surviving Git snapshot.</p></div></div></section>
</Base>
